        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2e278e45-90e1-3215-af72-6afad072af6b",
                "word": "aliéniste",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f45a2be3-8b11-4e5a-9c5d-121e99d5f90f",
                        "entry_id": "2e278e45-90e1-3215-af72-6afad072af6b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "aliénistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "65c0a4fa-3efa-39cf-9b79-9c8c0be99f8b",
                        "entry_id": "2e278e45-90e1-3215-af72-6afad072af6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui concerne les aliénés."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8648753f-1078-4a60-bbe1-73bcf723b94b",
                                "sense_id": "65c0a4fa-3efa-39cf-9b79-9c8c0be99f8b",
                                "text": "Je fixai les yeux, longtemps, sur celui qui me parlait ainsi, et tout à coup je reconnus le docteur Bertram, le célèbre médecin aliéniste de Dublin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "beecfeba-b2e9-4c20-9668-91738570b8fa",
                                "sense_id": "65c0a4fa-3efa-39cf-9b79-9c8c0be99f8b",
                                "text": "La médecine aliéniste."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abe2ad65-5c2c-46a7-aaeb-edd05e664cd6",
                                "sense_id": "65c0a4fa-3efa-39cf-9b79-9c8c0be99f8b",
                                "text": "Je rêvais, Plumkett, qu’on était en train de vous trépaner ; c’était un matelot charpentier de notre vaisseau qui exécutait ce travail, d’après les indications d’un médecin aliéniste que nous avions consulté."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e64beee-647e-4eae-986e-046bea42b53d",
                        "source_entry_id": "2e278e45-90e1-3215-af72-6afad072af6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "65c0a4fa-3efa-39cf-9b79-9c8c0be99f8b",
                        "target_lang_word": "alienista",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "b6a364b9-1701-31ce-a00b-d04e6b97e905",
                "word": "aliéniste",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fee2265e-4144-43e7-81f1-9b60dd091e84",
                        "entry_id": "b6a364b9-1701-31ce-a00b-d04e6b97e905",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "aliénistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23a1945b-81cf-3b14-9442-b06b48a8e51f",
                        "entry_id": "b6a364b9-1701-31ce-a00b-d04e6b97e905",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Médecin spécialiste du traitement des maladies mentales."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2452793b-7e91-429a-b1b7-3167983ae371",
                                "sense_id": "23a1945b-81cf-3b14-9442-b06b48a8e51f",
                                "text": "Puis, venaient les voleuses par manie, une perversion du désir, une névrose nouvelle qu’un aliéniste avait classée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd31ac3c-3bcd-467f-a1c2-d0d3ee48c478",
                                "sense_id": "23a1945b-81cf-3b14-9442-b06b48a8e51f",
                                "text": "Rien n’empêche un médecin d’être fou, ni un fou d’être médecin. On dit même que les aliénistes sont presque tous leurs propres clients."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed56f120-e565-4e65-97b3-4837fb80af16",
                                "sense_id": "23a1945b-81cf-3b14-9442-b06b48a8e51f",
                                "text": "L’homme n’est autre que l’illustre aliéniste Pinel, médecin en chef de la Salpêtrière, envoyé par Decazes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06e511ed-6f4f-4595-a0ec-0d98b10c02ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6a364b9-1701-31ce-a00b-d04e6b97e905",
                        "source_sense_id": "23a1945b-81cf-3b14-9442-b06b48a8e51f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Psychiater",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Psychiater",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "135b9e50-33ff-37ca-8009-ed5198870728",
                                        "entry_id": "3fc3e076-3a91-3ccb-99eb-d4b075f337ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Facharzt für Geistes- und Gemütskrankheiten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16f908a9-3fac-4d71-81a5-108bd693bd12",
                                                "sense_id": "135b9e50-33ff-37ca-8009-ed5198870728",
                                                "text": "Der Psychiater hat den Kranken in das Krankenhaus für Neurologie und Psychiatrie eingewiesen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48642a70-efc8-49c2-b017-893d761cc26e",
                                                "sense_id": "135b9e50-33ff-37ca-8009-ed5198870728",
                                                "text": "„Die Mutter einer Schizophrenen benachrichtigte den behandelnden Psychiater telefonisch, dass der Zustand ihrer Tochter sich wieder verschlechterte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c0a2ef-cfec-478a-bc6a-d75d67e87920",
                                                "sense_id": "135b9e50-33ff-37ca-8009-ed5198870728",
                                                "text": "„Ein Psychiater von heute hätte vielleicht die verschiedenartigsten narzißstischen Persönlichkeitsstörungen diagnostiziert.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8a3d7bc-51c1-4b5b-ac2d-4475fa64e102",
                                                "sense_id": "135b9e50-33ff-37ca-8009-ed5198870728",
                                                "text": "„Ich wäre dann auf jeden Fall irrsinnig, aber es ist mir trotzdem nie eingefallen, zum Psychiater zu gehen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cb63d82-949c-4e79-a015-b9f12d4a0fe7",
                                                "sense_id": "135b9e50-33ff-37ca-8009-ed5198870728",
                                                "text": "„Man saß im Wartezimmer eines Psychiaters in Gesellschaft von lauter Bekloppten und fragte sich, ob man selber einer war.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "da22d93e-3a60-4428-b9e9-285f5fc66f47",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6a364b9-1701-31ce-a00b-d04e6b97e905",
                        "source_sense_id": "23a1945b-81cf-3b14-9442-b06b48a8e51f",
                        "target_lang_word": "alienist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alienist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8073c860-01ae-3a3b-b040-aa910da81916",
                                        "entry_id": "b40b2bf9-9d6b-391d-b143-d54491d5c344",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expert in mental illness, especially with reference to legal ramifications."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6b8f3d6-e7b6-4ef7-8343-f7998f7034ca",
                                                "sense_id": "8073c860-01ae-3a3b-b040-aa910da81916",
                                                "text": "A trial for poisoning means an exhaustive study not only of analytic chemistry, but of practical medicine on the part of all the lawyers in the case, while a plea of insanity requires that, for the time being, the district attorney shall become an alienist, familiar with every aspect of paranoia, dementia praecox, and all other forms of mania."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9643e1b1-c401-4e63-a426-03d516be4ba4",
                                                "sense_id": "8073c860-01ae-3a3b-b040-aa910da81916",
                                                "text": "\"Speaking as a medical man,\" said I, \"it appears to be a case for an alienist. The old gentleman's cerebral processes were disturbed by the love affair.[…]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0501b76-d07c-4f58-a97c-cb3282af1467",
                                                "sense_id": "8073c860-01ae-3a3b-b040-aa910da81916",
                                                "text": "‘Are you an alienist?’ I interrupted. ‘Every doctor should be - a little,’ answered that original, imperturbably."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ae2c2bb-9513-4138-905e-b8d0311977e8",
                                                "sense_id": "8073c860-01ae-3a3b-b040-aa910da81916",
                                                "text": "There was probably not an alienist in the land who, having listened so far, would not have sprung at George and held him down with one hand while with the other he signed the necessary certificate of lunacy. But Molly Waddington saw deeper into the matter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc36cd27-4184-3550-8aa6-bd9019c777da",
                                        "entry_id": "b40b2bf9-9d6b-391d-b143-d54491d5c344",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A psychiatrist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
